<title>UK: CRICKET-HAMPSHIRE 128-6 V AUSTRALIA - LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-HAMPSHIRE 128-6 V AUSTRALIA - LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTHAMPTON, England 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hampshire were 128</p>
<p>for six in their second innings at lunch on the final day of a</p>
<p>three-day match against Australia on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: Hampshire 156 and 128-6. Australia 465-8 declared.</p>
</text>
